+    /**
+     * LOOM PATCH: atomic replace — write a sibling temp file, then rename() over
+     * the target. rename() is atomic on POSIX, so a concurrent reader sees either
+     * the complete old file or the complete new one, never the truncated state a
+     * plain writeFileSync (O_TRUNC, then stream) exposes. parseStorageData("")
+     * returns {} with no error, so that window is indistinguishable from "no
